{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_12",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:8f8b935b03cd6d55657be887c74a80163caa268509387967d5722e83b6fe8e1c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_12:1_2_045_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac26541c69ae6de1d5543be844e9b235ea46b121559c2d6052ff5d11ee29fb47",
      "text": "特殊日子的惊喜",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_12:1_2_045_12_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55977faa52bb9772b17ee3676a7f72fbbb1952f14c954c591591360f53a19b8c",
      "text": "生日当天。想乐正在阅读父母、哥哥、Legenders\n以及制作人发来的祝福信息。\n收到了雨彦和克里斯发来在事务所等他的信息，\n想乐则是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_12:1_2_045_12_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fecd104458de9a5cbcae0b3e47f43ac85c7dfac200626d180fbcc5a1e3e888bc",
      "text": "好嘞，生日会的准备差不多就是这样了吧。\n接下来就只要去接北村了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_12:1_2_045_12_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07a6d90496d9763346532488e00073bfefa63cc4f0babf353e172eaf7083d072",
      "text": "虽然稍微有点早，我们要不要出发去想乐的大学呢？\n毕竟还有之前没走过的路。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_12:1_2_045_12_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41e7f4e3ba22375a9e3875481a8a4910c134089f0ce9bafd350ed40e9f8386d6",
      "text": "我没意见。\n早点到总归没坏处的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_12:1_2_045_12_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68f73c8689d0ebd7fcba4967a0c58648fc07336f7bcf6393f82ed3b0188af39d",
      "text": "那么，我们去车子那边吧。\n我们去接他，想乐会不会吓一跳呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_12:1_2_045_12_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:728879fa640ecb9ba81581a64e209cdec99f3a779105258cca489f5a1fd48ac3",
      "text": "毫无疑问，绝对意想不到吧。\n真期待看到他的反应啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_12:1_2_045_12_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec0c719c2e54a472cbd43c015b18feae48f491f4312db142ac8a9e1b9e3c4539",
      "text": "北村，要不要我给你的生日占卜一卦星象？\n如果有你想占卜的事情的话啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_12:1_2_045_12_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38ecf425664b6cf68e9c9fcebf63d39e67c61e910d1ed1d193f575f7a9fd58cc",
      "text": "想占卜的事啊～。\n有什么好呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_12:1_2_045_12_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:029b4aa2cc0a9e6da0b402667a40517b7b9051d4055141e6e0a85b2ae0b899be",
      "text": "难得有机会，想请你帮Legenders接下来的这一年\n占卜一下呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_12:1_2_045_12_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6269f3941e61a81b218a820973afc0f38fe1286dd708d79f7bf06009cb816213",
      "text": "原来如此，这样啊。\n当然没问题。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_12:1_2_045_12_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3990b27d85c8b0e6e72b624ed632da2c47e71e4b82a443505a07260ac2250066",
      "text": "占卜结果我之后再联络你。\n会算出什么结果呢，我都开始期待占卜了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_12:1_2_045_12_c:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:505de84d3e3cf81fc7c99ded3e6f72c9375eddb47d69e0c27409b66c95974a52",
      "text": "说起来，车座上放着礼物\n是克里斯先生的主意吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_12:1_2_045_12_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:765b751c73f5ee8e6467eb5d678ec3ebb000623903d895f939dbf200de90e022",
      "text": "是的，没错。我想着这样能不能\n给想乐带来连续的惊喜呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_12:1_2_045_12_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00f6b76e92f07d9c4b90d53c01236cd87cbe26ca1233866fe0a5c1c640b3adc7",
      "text": "这样啊～。那种安排，真的会让人吓一跳\n呢～。亲身体验过才明白呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_12:1_2_045_12_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:356f3fca558184bac085deaabebfcb6a98e1736eab91e54f0ecf1e0a56a44d4b",
      "text": "惊喜大获成功了呢！\n礼物您还喜欢吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_12:1_2_045_12_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f698a80e11f02e98b62153820d6ef2967e1b3fd51fa968ae8cbeda299ac1be48",
      "text": "嗯。\n谢谢你准备了这么多哦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
